				Padding: 10
			Typography:
				Align: center
	Section:
		Text: The box
			Style: topic
		Heading 1:
			Text: Contrast
		Paragraph: A text must stand out from what lies beneath it: at least **4.5:1**, or **3:1** for large text (`Size` 18, or 14 in bold). Below that, the conversion stops with `CONTRAST_LOW`. Every pair on this page passes the check.
			Style: intro
		Text: Normal text, at least 4.5:1
			Style: label
